      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6 · PostgreSQL\n\nPrisma transaction commits.\nAuditLog / Outbox may share\nthe same tx. Envelope\nreturns;\nReact Query invalidates.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "box-101",
      "originalText": "6 · PostgreSQL\n\nPrisma transaction commits.\nAuditLog / Outbox may share\nthe same tx. Envelope\nreturns;\nReact Query invalidates.",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": false
    },
